{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Hunkkaar The Roar","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uL2qCVBou6WYMRxMbP5olmBpTjD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6zENIpSZvMGh2gfMKBeatpRtgX.jpg","description":"When a teenager accuses a revered cult leader of sexual assault, it sparks a national conflict. As the truth unravels, the line between faith and justice blurs.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 6/6","releaseInfo":"2026","genres":["Crime","Drama","Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Aarambh","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Seventeen-year-old Meenu Rawat accuses spiritual leader Baapji of sexual assault. Newly appointed ACP Jasleen Singh Soin takes charge of the case, and her uphill battle begins.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sq6rANDA20r8Fj3k85C2Wqj2211.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Aastha","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Despite resistance and rising violence, Jasleen arrests Baapji. Advocate Bhalerao steps in to represent Meenu. But before the bail hearing, Meenu's father lands in trouble.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8gqnR9Q3erYJHMHiEZKZaVqNZ35.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Shakti","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"At the bail hearings, the defence attacks Meenu's credibility, claiming she's a habitual liar. Outside, tensions rise as Baapji's son Kashyap gains control.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uHfHtNknqRRvudfrCm4lis1yRlk.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Arth","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"While exposing the disappearance of a child devotee, Amitabh's career is jeopardised. Jasleen uncovers proof of a ritual, which is in fact an industrial-scale abuse.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ujpHd3pCcvEIzSEzT9MOnwu9MqM.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Yudh","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Kashyap mysteriously dies in custody, and Baapji takes advantage of it. Outraged by the orchestrated media narrative, Amitabh helms a movement, appealing to the survivors.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6rr8WU8WtqNaGDb45kwwfm6o6Tj.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9IdW5ra2FhciUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYXIlMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Nyaya","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The defence presents one last witness to exonerate Baapji, which shocks Meenu. Finally, she takes the stand for the last time, recounting her assault with unflinching courage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5MnP8yPU7mF6N5yrajBUiY51PAP.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"8.0","runtime":"56 min","cast":["Aneet Padda","Fatima Sana Shaikh","Raghubir Yadav","Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub","Arjun Mathur","Rajesh Sharma","Charu Shankar","Zoya Hussain"],"director":["Karan Kapadia","Nitya Mehra"],"released":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The Truth Shall Roar","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Aneet Padda","character":"Meenu Rawat","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9YP19WwvZ6DkFwbCyfydUbh7TSt.jpg"},{"name":"Fatima Sana Shaikh","character":"ACP Jasleen Singh Soin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eVOziSvi6PLL5vk